Shashidhar,

I think there is currently an issue with desiredtz, where it's not being passed in to a function <https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/commit/d4d6c0858a473bf5aafef78023b96b5b2c4f80ff>.

But there's actually an issue with rmc.desiredtz as well where it's not read correctly <https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/commit/a7423562b47d5ca81b2ad0f09ce10a5d8c5fa4aa> (and in GGIR 2.10.1 this problem existed in a couple more places).

this hopefully should be fixed soon.

-Lena

